[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Do the English Speak English?]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:03.30]Do they speak English? | 他们会讲英语吗？
[00:12.26]Why does the writer not understand the porter? | 为什么作者听不懂搬运工的话？
[00:17.71]I arrived in London at last. | 我终于到了伦敦。
[00:21.05]The railway station was big, black and dark. | 火车站很大，又黑又暗。
[00:26.35]I did not know the way to my hotel, so I asked a porter. | 我不知道去饭店的路怎么走，于是向一个搬运工打听。
[00:32.60]I not only spoke English very carefully, but very clearly as well. | 我的英语讲得不但非常认真，而且咬字也非常清楚。
[00:40.16]The porter, however, could not understand me. | 然而搬运工就是听不懂我的话。
[00:44.44]I repeated my question several times and at last he understood. | 我把问话重复了很多遍，他终于听懂了。
[00:51.37]he answered me, but he spoke neither slowly nor clearly. | 他回答了我，但他讲得既不慢也不清楚。
[00:57.42]'I am a foreigner,' I said. | “我是个外国人，”我说。
[01:01.12]Then he spoke slowly, but I could not understand him. | 于是他说得慢了些，可我还是听不懂。
[01:07.15]My teacher never spoke English like that! | 我的老师从来不是这样讲英语的！
[01:11.68]The porter and I looked at each other and smiled. | 我和搬运工相视一笑。
[01:15.91]Then he said something and I understood it. | 接着他说了点什么，这回我听懂了。
[01:20.14]'You'll soon learn English!' he said. | “您很快就会学会英语的！”他说。
[01:24.32]I wonder. | 我不知道。
[01:26.53]In England, each person speaks a different language. | 在英国，每个人说的都是不同的语言。
[01:31.50]The English understand each other, but I don't understand them! | 英国人之间互相听得懂，可我却听不懂他们的话！
